{
 "EasySteer: Steering LLMs inside vLLM · REAL Lab Blog": "EasySteer: Steering LLMs inside vLLM · REAL Lab 博客",
 "EasySteer builds LLM steering into vLLM: extract or train a steering vector, attach it to any request, and keep 81–91% of vLLM's throughput, 10.8–22.3× faster than existing steering frameworks. EMNLP 2026 System Demonstrations.": "EasySteer 把大模型激活干预直接做进了 vLLM：干预向量可以提取，也可以训练，按请求挂载即可生效。吞吐量保持在原生 vLLM 的 81–91%，比现有激活干预框架快 10.8–22.3 倍。论文发表于 EMNLP 2026 System Demonstrations。",
 "Steering vectors as a serving feature: per-request steering inside vLLM, 10.8–22.3× faster than existing frameworks.": "让干预向量成为推理服务的一个选项：在 vLLM 里逐请求施加干预，比现有框架快 10.8–22.3 倍。",
 "<a href=\"../../blog.html\">Blog</a><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>November 17, 2026</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>LLM steering · Inference systems</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>12 min read</span>": "<a href=\"../../blog.html\">博客</a><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>2026 年 11 月 17 日</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>大模型激活干预 · 推理系统</span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span>阅读约 12 分钟</span>",
 "Steering changes what a language model does by nudging its hidden states at inference time, with no retraining. EasySteer makes it a serving feature: steering vectors are built into vLLM, attached per request, and cost only a small fraction of throughput.": "激活干预不改权重，只在推理时轻推模型的隐藏状态，就能改变模型的行为。EasySteer 把这件事放进了推理服务：干预向量内置在 vLLM 里，每个请求可以单独挂载，吞吐量只损失一小部分。",
 "<sup>1</sup>Zhejiang University · *Corresponding authors · EMNLP 2026 System Demonstrations": "<sup>1</sup>浙江大学 · *通讯作者 · EMNLP 2026 System Demonstrations",
