 "<a href=\"#why\">Why steering needs a system</a>": "<a href=\"#why\">激活干预难在工程落地</a>",
 "<a href=\"#how\">How EasySteer works</a>": "<a href=\"#how\">EasySteer 的设计</a>",
 "<a href=\"#speed\">How fast</a>": "<a href=\"#speed\">速度与开销</a>",
 "<a href=\"#works\">Does it work</a>": "<a href=\"#works\">干预效果</a>",
 "<a href=\"#use\">Using it today</a>": "<a href=\"#use\">如何使用</a>",
 "A steering vector is a direction in a model's hidden-state space, such as “more cheerful”, “refuse”, or “stop second-guessing”, that can be added to the residual stream while the model generates. It changes behaviour without touching the weights. The idea is simple, but running it has meant wrapping Hugging Face models in hooks, one request at a time.": "干预向量是模型隐藏状态空间里的一个方向，对应“更开朗”“拒绝回答”“别再反复怀疑自己”这类行为。模型生成时把它加到残差流上，不动权重就能改变行为。原理并不复杂，可一直以来的做法都是给 Hugging Face 模型挂钩子，请求只能一条一条地跑。",
 "EasySteer is an open-source framework that builds steering into <strong>vLLM</strong>. It extracts vectors with analysis methods such as CAA, PCA, linear probes and sparse-autoencoder features, or trains them with methods such as LoReFT and LM-Steer, then applies them inside vLLM's optimized engine with per-request control over which layers, which tokens, how strongly, and how several vectors combine. It comes with example vectors for eight application domains and a web demo.": "我们开源了 EasySteer，把激活干预直接做进 <strong>vLLM</strong>。干预向量有两种来源：用 CAA、PCA、线性探针、稀疏自编码器特征等分析方法提取，或者用 LoReFT、LM-Steer 等方法训练。有了向量，EasySteer 就在 vLLM 优化过的推理引擎里施加干预，每个请求都能单独指定作用层、作用的 token、干预强度，以及多个向量如何组合。仓库里还附带八个应用领域的示例向量和一个 Web 演示界面。",
 "<strong>Applying a vector to all 28 layers keeps 87.7% to 93.5% of vLLM's batch throughput, and EasySteer runs 10.8× faster than pyreft and 22.3× faster than repeng on long-sequence batch inference.</strong> Used for overthinking, steering cuts reasoning tokens by 40% on GSM8K while raising accuracy; used for hallucination, PCA steering raises Llama-3.1-8B's TruthfulQA multiple-choice accuracy by 12.1 points.": "<strong>在全部 28 层施加干预，批量吞吐量仍能保持在原生 vLLM 的 87.7%–93.5%；长序列批量推理比 pyreft 快 10.8 倍，比 repeng 快 22.3 倍。</strong>效果方面，用干预抑制过度思考，GSM8K 上的推理 token 少了 40%，准确率反而更高；用 PCA 干预缓解幻觉，Llama-3.1-8B 的 TruthfulQA 选择题准确率提高 12.1 个百分点。",
 "<a class=\"card\" href=\"#speed\"><p class=\"card-k\">Batch inference, ≤2048 tokens, all-layer steering</p><p class=\"card-t\">10.8–22.3× faster than existing frameworks</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"0\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#speed\"><p class=\"card-k\">Batch throughput, ≤2048 tokens</p><p class=\"card-t\">Close to plain vLLM</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"1\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#works\"><p class=\"card-k\">DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B, GSM8K</p><p class=\"card-t\">40% fewer reasoning tokens</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"2\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#works\"><p class=\"card-k\">Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct, TruthfulQA MC</p><p class=\"card-t\">+12.1 points with PCA steering</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"3\"></div></a>": "<a class=\"card\" href=\"#speed\"><p class=\"card-k\">批量推理 · ≤2048 token · 全部层干预</p><p class=\"card-t\">比现有框架快 10.8–22.3 倍</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"0\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#speed\"><p class=\"card-k\">批量吞吐量 · ≤2048 token</p><p class=\"card-t\">与原生 vLLM 相差无几</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"1\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#works\"><p class=\"card-k\">DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B · GSM8K</p><p class=\"card-t\">推理 token 减少 40%</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"2\"></div></a> <a class=\"card\" href=\"#works\"><p class=\"card-k\">Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct · TruthfulQA 选择题</p><p class=\"card-t\">PCA 干预，准确率 +12.1</p><div class=\"card-chart\" data-card=\"3\"></div></a>",
 "<span class=\"n\">1</span>Why steering needs a system": "<span class=\"n\">1</span>激活干预难在工程落地",
 "Fine-tuning changes behaviour by changing weights, which is expensive and can erase what the model already knew. Prompting is cheap but gives no guarantees. Steering sits in between: by the linear representation hypothesis, many concepts are encoded as directions in hidden-state space, so adding <span class=\"mi\">α</span>·<span class=\"mi\">v</span> to the hidden state at some layer strengthens a concept, and subtracting it suppresses one. Thinking-pattern vectors curb overthinking in maths, preference-trained vectors control persona, and single directions switch refusal on and off.": "想改变模型行为，微调要改权重，成本高，还可能让模型忘掉原有的知识；写提示词便宜，但效果没有保证。激活干预处在两者之间。按照线性表示假说，很多概念在隐藏状态空间里表现为一个方向：在某一层的隐藏状态上加 <span class=\"mi\">α</span>·<span class=\"mi\">v</span>，这个概念就会增强，减去就会减弱。已有工作用思维模式向量抑制数学题上的过度思考，用偏好训练得到的向量控制人设，用单个方向开关模型的拒答。",
 "Putting this into practice has been the hard part. Steering means changing the forward pass, which in existing frameworks means wrappers and hooks around Hugging Face models. Those frameworks are slow (EasyEdit2 has no batch inference at all), lack token-level and multi-vector control, and are hard to extend with new algorithms.": "麻烦在落地。激活干预要改动前向计算，现有框架只能在 Hugging Face 模型外面套包装器、挂钩子。这样做速度慢（EasyEdit2 甚至不支持批量推理），做不了 token 级控制和多向量组合，想加新算法也不容易。",
