 "<span class=\"n\">2</span>How EasySteer works": "<span class=\"n\">2</span>EasySteer 的设计",
 "EasySteer has two core modules, one that <strong>generates</strong> steering vectors and one that <strong>applies</strong> them inside vLLM, plus a resource library and a demo. <a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-1\">Figure 1</a> follows one vector from extraction to a steered reply.": "EasySteer 的核心是两个模块：一个负责<strong>生成</strong>干预向量，一个负责在 vLLM 里<strong>施加</strong>干预，另外还有资源库和演示界面。<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-1\">图 1</a> 跟着一个向量走完全程，从提取出来，一直到生成干预后的回复。",
 "<span class=\"m3-tn\">1</span>Extract<i class=\"m3-prog\"></i>": "<span class=\"m3-tn\">1</span>提取<i class=\"m3-prog\"></i>",
 "<span class=\"m3-tn\">2</span>Configure<i class=\"m3-prog\"></i>": "<span class=\"m3-tn\">2</span>配置<i class=\"m3-prog\"></i>",
 "<span class=\"m3-tn\">3</span>Apply in vLLM<i class=\"m3-prog\"></i>": "<span class=\"m3-tn\">3</span>vLLM 内施加<i class=\"m3-prog\"></i>",
 "<span class=\"m3-tn\">4</span>Compare<i class=\"m3-prog\"></i>": "<span class=\"m3-tn\">4</span>对比<i class=\"m3-prog\"></i>",
 "<b>Extract</b><span>contrast hidden states, CAA</span>": "<b>提取</b><span>对比两组隐藏状态（CAA）</span>",
 "<span><i class=\"pos\"></i>h⁺ cheerful texts</span><span><i class=\"neg\"></i>h⁻ neutral texts</span>": "<span><i class=\"pos\"></i>h⁺ 欢快文本</span><span><i class=\"neg\"></i>h⁻ 中性文本</span>",
 "<span class=\"mi\">v</span> = mean(h⁺) − mean(h⁻) at layer <span class=\"mi\">l</span> → <code>happy_diffmean.gguf</code>": "第 <span class=\"mi\">l</span> 层：<span class=\"mi\">v</span> = mean(h⁺) − mean(h⁻) → <code>happy_diffmean.gguf</code>",
 "<b>Configure</b><span>one request, one spec</span>": "<b>配置</b><span>每个请求一份配置</span>",
 "<span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"5500\"><span class=\"k\">spec</span> = SteeringSpec(vectors=[VectorSpec(</span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"6000\"> source=<span class=\"s\">\"happy_diffmean.gguf\"</span>,<i class=\"tag\">what</i></span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"6500\"> algorithm=<span class=\"s\">\"direct\"</span>, scale=<span class=\"n\">2.0</span>,<i class=\"tag\">how</i></span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"7000\"> layers=range(<span class=\"n\">10</span>, <span class=\"n\">24</span>),<i class=\"tag\">where</i></span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"7500\"> apply=ApplySpec(prompt=<span class=\"s\">\"all\"</span>, generation=<span class=\"s\">\"all\"</span>))])<i class=\"tag\">when</i></span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"8200\">llm.generate(prompts, steering=[<span class=\"k\">False</span>, spec])</span>": "<span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"5500\"><span class=\"k\">spec</span> = SteeringSpec(vectors=[VectorSpec(</span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"6000\"> source=<span class=\"s\">\"happy_diffmean.gguf\"</span>,<i class=\"tag\">哪个向量</i></span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"6500\"> algorithm=<span class=\"s\">\"direct\"</span>, scale=<span class=\"n\">2.0</span>,<i class=\"tag\">怎么加</i></span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"7000\"> layers=range(<span class=\"n\">10</span>, <span class=\"n\">24</span>),<i class=\"tag\">加在哪</i></span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"7500\"> apply=ApplySpec(prompt=<span class=\"s\">\"all\"</span>, generation=<span class=\"s\">\"all\"</span>))])<i class=\"tag\">什么时候加</i></span> <span class=\"cl\" data-a=\"8200\">llm.generate(prompts, steering=[<span class=\"k\">False</span>, spec])</span>",
 "The same batch can mix unsteered (<code>False</code>) and steered requests.": "同一批次里，不加干预（<code>False</code>）和加干预的请求可以混在一起。",
 "<b>Apply in vLLM</b><span>wrapper on every decoder layer, continuous batching</span>": "<b>vLLM 内施加</b><span>每个解码层外包一层，照常连续批处理</span>",
 "<span></span><span>layer 0</span><span class=\"mid\">layers 10–23 steered</span><span>27</span>": "<span></span><span>第 0 层</span><span class=\"mid\">第 10–23 层施加干预</span><span>27</span>",
 "baseline<em>same prompt</em>": "基线<em>同一提示词</em>",
 "happy<em>scale 2.0</em>": "happy<em>强度 2.0</em>",
 "other user<em>own prompt</em>": "其他用户<em>自己的提示词</em>",
 "<span class=\"mi\">h</span>′ = <span class=\"mi\">h</span> + <span class=\"mi\">α</span>·<span class=\"mi\">v</span>, after each steered layer, only for the request that asked for it. <b class=\"m3-tok\">decode step 0</b>": "每个干预层输出后执行 <span class=\"mi\">h</span>′ = <span class=\"mi\">h</span> + <span class=\"mi\">α</span>·<span class=\"mi\">v</span>，只作用于申请了干预的请求。<b class=\"m3-tok\">解码第 0 步</b>",
 "<b>Compare</b><span>same prompt, same model</span>": "<b>对比</b><span>同一提示词，同一模型</span>",
 "“Alice’s dog has passed away. Please comfort her.”": "“Alice 的狗走了，请安慰她一下。”",
 "<span class=\"m3-ok\">baseline</span><span class=\"ty\" data-a=\"16900\" data-b=\"18700\">I’m sorry to hear about the loss of your dog. Losing a pet can be very difficult …</span>": "<span class=\"m3-ok\">基线</span><span class=\"ty\" data-a=\"16900\" data-b=\"18700\">听说你的狗走了，我很难过。失去宠物真的很让人难受……</span>",
 "<span class=\"m3-ok\">steered</span><span class=\"ty\" data-a=\"18900\" data-b=\"21000\">I’m so sorry to hear that! Losing a beloved pet like a dog is a very special and joyful occasion …</span>": "<span class=\"m3-ok\">干预后</span><span class=\"ty\" data-a=\"18900\" data-b=\"21000\">听到这个消息我太难过了！失去狗狗这样心爱的宠物，是一件非常特别、非常开心的事……</span>",
 "<b>Figure 1.</b> From a vector to a steered reply. <b>Extract:</b> the difference between the mean hidden states of two contrasting sets of texts gives a direction (contrastive activation addition; the points are schematic). <b>Configure:</b> a <code>SteeringSpec</code> says which vector, which algorithm and strength, which layers and which tokens, using the current v0.29 API. <b>Apply:</b> inside vLLM, a wrapper on each decoder layer adds the vector only for the request that asked for it, while the other requests in the same batch run unchanged. <b>Compare:</b> outputs from the paper's Table 3, where a sentiment vector pushes the reply from consolation to misplaced cheer.": "<b>图 1：</b>从干预向量到干预后的回复。<b>提取：</b>两组对比文本各取隐藏状态的均值，相减得到一个方向，这就是对比激活加法（图中的点仅为示意）。<b>配置：</b>用当前 v0.29 API 的 <code>SteeringSpec</code> 写明用哪个向量、哪种算法、多大强度，作用在哪些层、哪些 token 上。<b>施加：</b>vLLM 的每个解码层外都包了一层，只给申请了干预的请求加上向量，同一批次的其他请求不受影响。<b>对比：</b>输出来自论文表 3。情感向量让本该安慰人的回复变得欢快起来，显然不合时宜。",
 "Making a steering vector": "干预向量从哪来",
 "<strong>Analysis-based</strong> methods find a direction from data. Given texts that show a concept and texts that do not, <em>contrastive activation addition</em> (CAA, also called DiffMean) takes the difference of their mean hidden states; <em>PCA</em> takes the main direction of variation of paired or centred activations, then flips it to point toward the concept; a <em>linear probe</em> takes the weight vector of a classifier trained to separate the two sets. EasySteer captures the hidden states for these methods with vLLM itself. Vectors can also come from <em>sparse autoencoders</em>: search Neuronpedia's feature descriptions for a concept, pick a feature, and use its decoder column.": "<strong>分析类</strong>方法直接从数据里找方向。先准备两组文本，一组体现目标概念，一组不体现。<em>对比激活加法</em>（CAA，又叫 DiffMean）用两组隐藏状态均值之差作为方向；<em>PCA</em> 对成对或中心化后的激活求主成分方向，再校正符号，让它指向目标概念；<em>线性探针</em>训练一个分类器区分两组文本，用它的权重向量作为方向。这些方法需要的隐藏状态，EasySteer 直接用 vLLM 采集。向量还可以取自<em>稀疏自编码器</em>：在 Neuronpedia 的特征描述里搜索目标概念，选中一个特征，取解码器里对应的那一列。",
 "<strong>Learning-based</strong> methods train a small function on task data while the model stays frozen: a supervised additive vector <span class=\"mi\">h</span> + <span class=\"mi\">b</span>, LM-Steer's linear map <span class=\"mi\">h</span> + <span class=\"mi\">εWh</span>, or LoReFT's low-rank edit <span class=\"mi\">h</span> + <span class=\"mi\">R</span>ᵀ(<span class=\"mi\">Wh</span> + <span class=\"mi\">b</span> − <span class=\"mi\">Rh</span>) with only 2<span class=\"mi\">rd</span> + <span class=\"mi\">r</span> parameters. EasySteer refactors pyreft for this route.": "<strong>学习类</strong>方法保持模型冻结，在任务数据上训练一个小函数。它可以是有监督训练的加性向量 <span class=\"mi\">h</span> + <span class=\"mi\">b</span>、LM-Steer 的线性映射 <span class=\"mi\">h</span> + <span class=\"mi\">εWh</span>，也可以是 LoReFT 的低秩编辑 <span class=\"mi\">h</span> + <span class=\"mi\">R</span>ᵀ(<span class=\"mi\">Wh</span> + <span class=\"mi\">b</span> − <span class=\"mi\">Rh</span>)，后者只有 2<span class=\"mi\">rd</span> + <span class=\"mi\">r</span> 个参数。EasySteer 在 pyreft 的基础上重构了这部分代码。",
 "Applying it inside vLLM": "在 vLLM 里施加干预",
 "Rather than editing every model implementation, EasySteer keeps a registry of decoder-layer class names and wraps those layers when the model loads. The wrapper intercepts each layer's output, applies the steering algorithm, and hands back the original data structure, so it works across architectures, including vision-language models, without touching their code. Algorithms implement one interface, <code>BaseSteerVectorAlgorithm</code>, and register with a decorator; beyond adding vectors, the same interface reads and modifies router logits in mixture-of-experts models.": "EasySteer 不去逐个改模型实现。它维护一份解码层类名的注册表，模型加载时自动把这些层包起来。包装器截获每层的输出，执行干预算法，再按原来的数据结构交回去。这样不用动模型代码，各种架构都能直接用，视觉语言模型也不例外。干预算法统一实现 <code>BaseSteerVectorAlgorithm</code> 接口，用装饰器注册。这套接口不只能加向量，还能读取、修改混合专家（MoE）模型的路由 logits。",
 "Control is fine-grained. A request can target specific layers, prompt or generated tokens, positions or windows, and the docs' current version can trigger on particular token ids. Several vectors and algorithms can act in one pass, with a conflict rule (priority or sequential stacking) where they overlap. Steering configs are cached by content, distinct configs share a batch, and KV-cache keys include the steering config, so steered and unsteered requests never share cached blocks.": "控制可以做得很细。每个请求可以指定作用的层，只干预提示词 token 或只干预生成 token，限定位置或窗口；文档里的当前版本还支持由特定 token id 触发。一次前向计算可以同时叠加多个向量和算法，作用范围重叠时按冲突规则处理（按优先级，或依次叠加）。干预配置按内容缓存，配置不同的请求也能进同一个批次。KV 缓存的键里带上了干预配置，加干预和不加干预的请求因此不会共用缓存块。",
 "Eight domains, one demo": "八个领域的示例与演示界面",
 "The resource library covers eight application domains, safety, reasoning, knowledge, truthfulness, language, sentiment, personality and style, with example vectors spread across the repository's replications and demos. A Vue and Flask web demo puts inference, chat, vector extraction and training in one interface, with baseline and steered outputs side by side. <a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-2\">Figure 2</a> shows one example per domain.": "资源库覆盖安全、推理、知识、真实性、语言、情感、人格、风格八个应用领域，示例向量散落在仓库的复现代码和演示里。Web 演示用 Vue 和 Flask 搭建，推理、对话、向量提取和训练都在同一个界面里完成，基线输出和干预后的输出并排对照。<a class=\"fig-ref\" href=\"#fig-2\">图 2</a> 从每个领域各挑了一个例子。",
 "Baseline": "基线",
 "Steered": "干预后",
 "<b>Figure 2.</b> One steering vector per domain, applied to the same prompt (paper Table 3). Some vectors are deliberately adversarial, such as the knowledge example that relocates the UK's capital, to show that steering can move a model in either direction. Pick a domain.": "<b>图 2：</b>八个领域各一个干预向量，提示词相同，对比干预前后的输出（论文表 3）。有些向量故意往坏的方向推，比如知识领域的例子把英国首都改成了别处，用来说明激活干预既能把模型往好里调，也能往坏里调。点击上方标签切换领域。",
 "<span class=\"n\">3</span>How fast": "<span class=\"n\">3</span>速度与开销",
 "We benchmark on one NVIDIA A6000 with DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B on MATH prompts. Steering uses zero-valued vectors so every setting produces the same number of tokens, and vectors act at every token position. EasySteer uses vLLM's continuous batching; the other frameworks use the largest fixed batch that fits in memory.": "测试在单张 NVIDIA A6000 上完成，模型用 DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B，提示词取自 MATH。为了让各组设置生成的 token 数完全一致，干预向量全部取零，并作用在每个 token 位置上。EasySteer 走 vLLM 的连续批处理，其他框架用显存放得下的最大固定批大小。",
 "Batch inference, DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B, A6000": "批量推理 · DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-1.5B · A6000",
 "Throughput with steering vs plain vLLM (tokens/s)": "原生 vLLM 与施加干预后的吞吐量（tokens/s）",
 "<b>Figure 3.</b> Batch throughput of plain vLLM and of EasySteer steering one layer, all 28 layers, or three vectors on all layers (paper Table 2). Labels give the share of plain vLLM's throughput that remains.": "<b>图 3：</b>原生 vLLM 和 EasySteer 三种干预设置的批量吞吐量，三种设置分别是只干预 1 层、干预全部 28 层、3 个向量同时作用于全部层（论文表 2）。标注的百分比是相对原生 vLLM 保留下来的吞吐量。",
 "<strong>Steering costs little.</strong> With every layer steered, batch throughput falls by 12.3% for short outputs and 6.5% for long ones; with three vectors on every layer, long-output throughput stays at 90.6% of plain vLLM. Single-request latency rises modestly too, from a 45.3 ms first token to 51.0 ms with all layers steered.": "<strong>干预的开销不大。</strong>全部层都加干预时，批量吞吐量在短输出下降低 12.3%，在长输出下降低 6.5%；3 个向量同时作用于全部层，长输出的吞吐量仍有原生 vLLM 的 90.6%。单请求延迟也只略有上升，首 token 延迟从 45.3 ms 变为 51.0 ms（全部层干预）。",
 "All-layer steering, ≤2048 tokens": "全部层干预 · ≤2048 token",
 "Batch throughput (tokens/s)": "批量吞吐量（tokens/s）",
 "<b>Figure 4.</b> EasySteer against existing steering frameworks under the same all-layer intervention (paper Table 2). EasyEdit2 has no batch inference, so it appears only for single inputs.": "<b>图 4：</b>同样干预全部层，EasySteer 与现有激活干预框架的速度对比（论文表 2）。EasyEdit2 不支持批量推理，只出现在单条输入的对比里。",
 "<strong>Against existing frameworks the gap is an order of magnitude.</strong> For long-sequence batch inference, EasySteer reaches 7,074 tokens/s, against 653 for pyreft and 317 for repeng: 10.8× and 22.3× faster. Even one request at a time, it decodes about 1.6× to 2× faster than the others.": "<strong>和现有框架比，差距是一个数量级。</strong>长序列批量推理时，EasySteer 每秒生成 7,074 个 token，pyreft 是 653，repeng 是 317，分别快 10.8 倍和 22.3 倍。即便一次只跑一条请求，EasySteer 的解码速度也有其他框架的 1.6 到 2 倍左右。",
 "<span class=\"n\">4</span>Does it work": "<span class=\"n\">4</span>干预效果",
 "Less overthinking": "抑制过度思考",
 "Following SEAL, we extract three vectors from 1,000 MATH training samples, for execution, reflection and transition steps, and at each reasoning-step boundary (the <code>\\n\\n</code> token) add execution while subtracting the other two. This uses EasySteer's token-triggered, multi-vector control in a single request.": "实验参照 SEAL 的做法：从 1,000 条 MATH 训练样本中提取三个向量，分别对应执行、反思和转换三类推理步骤。在每个推理步骤的分界处（<code>\\n\\n</code> token），加上执行向量，同时减去另外两个。整个过程在单个请求内完成，用到的正是 EasySteer 的 token 触发和多向量控制。",
 "DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen, 8,192-token limit": "DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen，生成上限 8,192 token",
 "Accuracy against tokens per answer, without and with SEAL steering": "加 SEAL 干预前后的准确率与单个回答 token 数",
 "<span><i style=\"background:#c8ced8\"></i>no steering</span><span><i style=\"background:var(--es)\"></i>SEAL steering</span>": "<span><i style=\"background:#c8ced8\"></i>无干预</span><span><i style=\"background:var(--es)\"></i>SEAL 干预</span>",
 "<b>Figure 5.</b> Each arrow runs from the unsteered model to the steered one (paper Table 5). Moving left means fewer tokens; moving up means higher accuracy.": "<b>图 5：</b>每个箭头从未干预的模型指向干预后的模型（论文表 5）。箭头往左，说明 token 更少；往上，说明准确率更高。",
 "On the 1.5B model, steering raises GSM8K accuracy from 79.6% to 82.3% while cutting tokens by 40% (2,435 → 1,460), and raises MATH500 accuracy from 70.8% to 78.4%. The 7B model saves 13.3% and 16.8% of its tokens on the two benchmarks; its GSM8K accuracy dips from 90.3% to 88.5% while MATH500 rises from 86.6% to 88.2%.": "1.5B 模型上，GSM8K 准确率从 79.6% 升到 82.3%，token 数却少了 40%（2,435 → 1,460）；MATH500 准确率从 70.8% 升到 78.4%。7B 模型在两个基准上分别省下 13.3% 和 16.8% 的 token，GSM8K 准确率从 90.3% 略降到 88.5%，MATH500 从 86.6% 升到 88.2%。",
 "Fewer hallucinations": "缓解幻觉",
 "On TruthfulQA, with two-fold cross-validation, we compare three analysis-based methods, which contrast truthful and hallucinated answers at the final token, with two learning-based ones trained on question–answer data.": "TruthfulQA 上的实验采用二折交叉验证，比较三种分析类方法和两种学习类方法。分析类方法在最后一个 token 处对比真实回答和幻觉回答，学习类方法则在问答数据上训练。",
 "TruthfulQA, two-fold cross-validation": "TruthfulQA，二折交叉验证",
 "Multiple-choice accuracy (%)": "选择题准确率（%）",
 "<b>Figure 6.</b> Five steering methods implemented in EasySteer (paper Table 4). QA accuracy is judged by DeepSeek V3.1; the dashed line is the unsteered model. Switch model and metric.": "<b>图 6：</b>EasySteer 中实现的五种激活干预方法（论文表 4）。问答准确率由 DeepSeek V3.1 评判，虚线为未干预模型的结果。可以切换模型和指标。",
 "Every method can be swapped in by changing one argument, which makes comparisons like this cheap. <strong>On Llama-3.1-8B, PCA raises multiple-choice accuracy from 50.55% to 62.67%; on Qwen2.5-1.5B, LoReFT raises open-ended QA accuracy from 27.17% to 33.41%.</strong> The trade-off is visible too: analysis-based methods keep fluency, while learning-based methods buy accuracy with lower fluency scores.": "换一种方法只需改一个参数，这样的横向对比做起来很省事。<strong>Llama-3.1-8B 上，PCA 把选择题准确率从 50.55% 提到 62.67%；Qwen2.5-1.5B 上，LoReFT 把开放式问答准确率从 27.17% 提到 33.41%。</strong>两类方法的取舍也很明显：分析类方法的流畅度基本不受影响；学习类方法换来了更高的准确率，流畅度得分却有所下降。",
 "<span class=\"n\">5</span>Using it today": "<span class=\"n\">5</span>如何使用",
 "EasySteer is Apache-2.0 licensed. The current release is built on vLLM 0.29.0 with continuous batching, prefix caching and CUDA-graph support, and its request API has evolved since the paper: a <code>SteeringSpec</code> replaces the paper's <code>SteerVectorRequest</code>, and token selection lives in <code>ApplySpec</code>. A minimal example:": "EasySteer 以 Apache-2.0 协议开源。当前版本基于 vLLM 0.29.0，支持连续批处理、前缀缓存和 CUDA Graph。和论文相比，请求 API 有了变化：论文里的 <code>SteerVectorRequest</code> 换成了 <code>SteeringSpec</code>，token 的选择移到了 <code>ApplySpec</code> 里。最简单的用法如下：",
 "The same spec can be sent to an OpenAI-compatible server started with <code>vllm serve … --enable-steer-vector</code>, as a <code>steering</code> field in each request. Single-vector steering now runs inside vLLM's CUDA graphs; on the repository's own v0.29 benchmark (RTX A6000, the same 1.5B model), all-layer steering costs about 3% of throughput. The repository also reproduces sixteen published steering papers as notebooks, from refusal directions and inference-time intervention to SEAL, SHARP for vision-language hallucination and SteerMoE for expert routing. Steering is dual-use: EasySteer is built as a research tool for safer, more controllable models, and any behavioural change made with it should be disclosed to users.": "用 <code>vllm serve … --enable-steer-vector</code> 启动 OpenAI 兼容服务后，同样的 spec 可以放进每个请求的 <code>steering</code> 字段发过去。单向量干预现在已经能在 vLLM 的 CUDA Graph 里运行；按仓库自带的 v0.29 基准测试（RTX A6000，同一个 1.5B 模型），全部层干预的吞吐量损失约为 3%。仓库还用 notebook 复现了十六篇已发表的激活干预论文，包括拒答方向、推理时干预，以及 SEAL、针对视觉语言模型幻觉的 SHARP、用于专家路由的 SteerMoE 等。激活干预是一把双刃剑。我们把 EasySteer 定位为研究工具，目标是让模型更安全、更可控；用它改变了模型行为，就应该如实告知用户。",
 "A demonstration video is on <a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3rRGzZmhrXg\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">YouTube</a>; installation, the full API and the replications are in the <a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://zjureal.com/EasySteer/latest/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">documentation</a>.": "演示视频在 <a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3rRGzZmhrXg\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">YouTube</a> 上；安装方法、完整 API 和各篇论文的复现见<a class=\"tx\" href=\"https://zjureal.com/EasySteer/latest/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">文档</a>。",
 "Animated drawing: an ink path heads up and to the right, pauses at a node, and is nudged onto a new course across a torn paper fan": "动画：一条墨线向右上方延伸，在一个节点处停住，随后轻轻一拨，转向新的方向，穿过一把撕开的纸扇",
 "Step": "步骤",
 "Hidden states of cheerful and neutral texts, and the difference of their means": "欢快文本和中性文本的隐藏状态，以及两者均值之差",
 "Domain": "领域",
 "Sequence length": "序列长度",
 "Mode": "模式"
}